flowchart LR
 _Prelude_(["Acquire the cell phone from the police captain and erase its data."])
 _A0_(["The team walks into the police station and approaches the front desk."])
 _A1_(["Eyeing up the crew, the desk officer asks them to state their business."])
 _A1_C1_{"Techie reports a carjacking and slips in the code phrase #quot;goose chase.#quot;"}
 _A1_C1F_["The officer takes down the report, seemingly failing to notice the code phrase."]
 _A1_C2_{"Negotiator repeats the story, emphasizing #quot;goose chase.”"}
 _A1_C2P_["Something clicks in the officer&#39;s brain. He invites the team to follow him through."]
 _A2_(["He escorts the team to the interrogation room."])
 _A2_1_(["Alerted to their presence, the captain enters the room, locking the door behind him."])
 _A2_2_(["Sitting across from the captain, Techie places a stack of bills onto the table."])
 _A2_3_(["The captain demands to know what the team will do with the cell phone."])
 _A2_C1_{"Negotiator avoids the question, promising it&#39;ll be returned in its current state."}
 _A2_C1F_["The captain claims the phone is in storage, promising to wipe it himself."]
 _A2_4_(["Techie scoffs, insisting that this is not the deal they agreed to."])
 _A2_5_(["The captain holds his ground, telling Techie to take it or leave it."])
 _A2_C2_{"Imitator says it would be risky for the captain to tamper with the cell phone."}
 _A2_C2P_["Unable to argue with this logic, the captain retrieves the cell phone from his pocket."]
 _A3_(["Techie goes for the phone, but the captain grabs it back and demands more cash."])
 _A3_C1_{"Imitator threatens to expose the captain&#39;s corrupt nature if he doesn’t comply."}
 _A3_C1P_["The captain smiles and backs down, claiming it was just a joke."]
 _A4_(["Negotiator urges him to hand over the goods. The captain complies."])
 _A4_1_(["As the team goes to leave, they spot the victim and his lawyer in the lobby!"])
 _A4_1_Cont_(["Concerned this could be a setup, the crew dips down a corridor to figure out a plan."])
 _A4_2_(["Needing a way out, Negotiator tries the exit to the cop car depot, but it&#39;s locked."])
 _A4_3_(["As the team regroups, they spot a junior officer heading to the depot."])
 _A4_4_(["Imitator leads the way as the team tries to tailgate him out of the building."])
 _A4_C1_{"The officer asks if they have authority to be here. Imitator flashes his badge."}
 _A4_C1F_["The officer furrows his brow and asks why he hasn&#39;t seen Imitator around before."]
 _A4_C2_{"Imitator says he has been undercover, smiling sarcastically."}
 _A4_C2P_["The junior officer backs down. Imitator berates the poor kid on their way out."]
 _A5_2_(["Techie and Negotiator sneak around the corner to wipe the cell phone."])
 _A5_3_(["The device&#39;s battery has run out, preventing them from accessing the evidence."])
 _A6_(["The team has no option but to physically destroy the device."])
 _A6_C1_{"Techie throws the phone to the ground and stomps on it as hard as he can."}
 _A6_C1F_["The device&#39;s screen is shattered but it still functions."]
 _A6_C2_{"Negotiator picks up the phone and starts bashing it against a nearby dumpster."}
 _A6_C2F_["The phone is dented and scraped but remains functional–it must be a Nokia 3310."]
 _A6_2_(["Another officer emerges from the station to investigate the noise."])
 _A6_C3_{"Imitator stalls the curious cop with a convoluted explanation."}
 _A6_C3P_["Negotiator finally cracks the phone and finds the memory card, which he snaps."]
 _A6_3_(["Techie and Negotiator head inside, telling their comrade it&#39;s time to go."])
 _A6S_(["With the task complete, the crew manages a clean getaway without raising any suspicion."])
 _A1_C1P_["Meeting Techie&#39;s eye, the officer nods and gestures for the crew to follow him."]
 _A3_C1F_["The captain is unmoved, confident Imitator could not harm his reputation."]
 _A3_C2_{"The captain&#39;s family is threatened, Negotiator insisting he&#39;d make them suffer."}
 _A3_C2F_["His eyebrows raised, the captain bravely invites Negotiator to do his worst."]
 _A3_C3_{"Techie reveals he has been recording the conversation on his cell phone."}
 _A3_C3P_["Furious at the betrayal, the captain concedes, realizing he could now be blackmailed."]
 _A2_C1P_["Accepting her promise, the captain pulls out the cell phone and places it on the table."]
 _A4_C1P_["Imitator intimidates the junior officer and orders him outside for a lecture."]
 _A5_(["Techie and Negotiator slip around the corner to wipe the cell phone."])
 _A5_1_(["Techie turns on the device, noticing it&#39;s down to 2% battery."])
 _A5_C1_{"Techie quickly punches in the phone&#39;s security code."}
 _A5_C1F_["Techie&#39;s fat fingers open a video app, causing the battery to drain."]
 _A6_C3F_["Realizing she&#39;s being played, the cop pushes Imitator away and rounds the corner."]
 _A6_6_(["Techie and Negotiator are discovered while trying to destroy evidence!"])
 _A6F_(["The entire team is arrested, the mission having been a complete and utter failure."])
 _A3_C2P_["Face reddening with rage, the captain backs down, agreeing to stick to the original deal."]
 _A6_C1P_["The device cracks open. Negotiator picks out the memory chip and snaps it in two."]
 _A8_(["Techie and Negotiator head inside, indicating that it&#39;s time to leave."])
 _A8_1_(["A senior officer intercepts the team, demanding to know where they&#39;ve just been."])
 _A8_C1_{"Negotiator tries to convince the officer they got lost on their way out."}
 _A8_C1P_["The cop buys this excuse and shows the team to the correct exit."]
 _A8S1_(["With the phone destroyed, the team departs, having saved their client from prosecution."])
 _A6_C2P_["The phone&#39;s guts spill out, letting Negotiator find and destroy the memory chip."]
 _A8_C1F_["As Imitator goes for her badge, the cop shoots, assuming she&#39;s drawing a gun."]
 _A8S2_(["Techie and Negotiator flee, somehow managing to avoid being shot."])
 _A1_C2F_["The officer acknowledges the phrase but his colleague frowns, realizing something is off."]
 _A1_1_(["To cover his tracks, the officer feigns anger and claims Negotiator is mocking him."])
 _A1_2_(["Techie and Negotiator are told to step away from the desk, and they obey."])
 _A1F_(["The team exits the police station to avoid attracting any further suspicion."])
 _A5_C1P_["Having accessed the phone, Techie erases the incriminating evidence."]
 _A7_(["Techie and Negotiator head inside, gesturing that the job is done."])
 _A7_2_(["As the team enters, a senior officer queries what they were doing in the depot."])
 _A7_C1_{"Imitator innocently claims they were lost. Negotiator flashes his badge."}
 _A7_C1P_["The officer is duped and escorts the team back to the interrogation room."]
 _A7S_(["The cell phone is returned to the captain and the team exits, its mission complete."])
 _A7_C1F_["Recognizing it&#39;s a forgery, the officer slams Negotiator against a wall."]
 _A7S2_(["The rest of the team escapes, leaving Negotiator to face the consequences."])
 _A3_C3F_["Calmly, the captain rises, a chilling smile on his face as he strides out of the room."]
 _A3_3_(["Two burly officers enter. They accuse the crew of trying to bribe the captain."])
 _A3F_(["With no way out, the team is arrested, bringing its mission to an abrupt end."])
 _A4_C2F_["The officer shouts for backup, announcing that there are intruders in the building."]
 _A4_5_(["Officers descend on the team&#39;s position, preventing them from leaving."])
 _A4F_(["The team is arrested for trespassing. The captain denies all knowledge of their deal."])
 _A2_C2F_["Pocketing the cash, the captain insists that it&#39;s time for the team to leave."]
 _B1_(["On their way out, the team spots an evidence technician entering the interrogation room."])
 _B1_1_(["She leaves with the cell phone in her hand—the captain was lying!"])
 _B1_2_(["The technician enters the evidence locker, deposits the phone, and stands at her station."])
 _B1_C1_{"Imitator shows his badge and demands entry to the evidence locker."}
 _B1_C1P_["The technician grants Imitator access to the locker without hesitation."]
 _B2_(["Imitator enters and starts looking for the cell phone."])
 _B2_C1_{"Techie and Negotiator try to distract the technician."}
 _B2_C1P_["The team engages the technician in small talk, buying Imitator more time."]
 _B3_(["Imitator finds the cell phone with a dead battery, so he pockets it and leaves."])
 _B3_1_(["After thanking the technician, the team exits the station with the cell phone."])
 _B3_2_(["Safely outside, Imitator retrieves the pocketed cell phone, smashing it to bits."])
 _B3S_(["With the evidence destroyed, the team has helped the client avoid prosecution."])
 _B1_C1F_["The technician refuses to comply as she doesn&#39;t recognize Imitator."]
 _B1_C2_{"Negotiator interjects, insisting it&#39;s a matter of life and death."}
 _B1_C2P_["The technician gives in and allows Imitator to access the evidence locker."]
 _B2_C1F_["Their attempts arouse suspicion and the technician raises the alarm."]
 _B2_3_(["The technician pushes a button under her desk, locking the door to trap Imitator."])
 _B2_4_(["Imitator pleads in vain as several officers arrive to intervene."])
 _B2F_(["Imitator is arrested for impersonating a police officer while the others escape."])
 _B1_C2F_["The technician exits the evidence locker, telling the team she will speak to the captain."]
 _B1_3_(["Left with no alternative, the team frantically tries to break into the locker."])
 _B1_4_(["The noise draws the attention of several nearby officers."])
 _B1F_(["The team is arrested for trespassing, completely failing in their mission."])

